    "sections": {
        "description": "Pixel Jewelry Theme provides a modern layout structure intended for product presentation, catalog management, and content publishing. The theme includes homepage sections for featured collections, promotional banners, image sliders, customer reviews, and contact details. Its responsive framework adjusts layouts across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Customization settings allow changes to colors, fonts, header styles, and page layouts without modifying core files. The theme also supports integration with eCommerce plugins for product listings, cart functionality, and checkout pages. Additional template sections are available for blogs, galleries, FAQs, and informational pages. Pixel Jewelry Theme includes organized navigation menus, widget-ready areas, and social media integration to support content accessibility. The codebase is designed to maintain compatibility with standard plugins and recent platform updates. It also supports high-resolution product imagery and structured content blocks to help display jewelry items, collections, and brand-related information in a consistent format across pages."
    },
